{"id":"wb-1-79","name":"南禅寺大殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南禅寺 (五台)","text":"南禅寺位于中华人民共和国山西省五台县阳白乡李家庄村西北。大殿建于唐建中三年（782年），为两村村民合资所建。因其位置偏，规模小，在县志并无记载，故唐武宗会昌法难时期得以保存。寺院自建成始，香火延续千年，后朝均有修缮，惟余大殿，乃唐代遗构。南禅寺是中国现存最古老的木结构建筑，1961年公布为全国重点文物保护单位。大殿坐北朝南，单檐九脊顶，构架抬梁式，其多种木构技法已成孤例，对后世研究唐代建筑具有重大意义。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E7%A6%85%E5%AF%BA_(%E4%BA%94%E5%8F%B0)","revisionId":92604119,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92604119","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5e935ab332014125d3bcca24.jpg","title":"南禅寺大殿正面二.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%97%E7%A6%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%E4%BA%8C.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/%E5%8D%97%E7%A6%85%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%E4%BA%8C.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Patrick20242023","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"南禅寺大殿正面二","width":320,"height":240}}